{"message":"The reserve for product warranties is disclosed as $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005. I compute the 2005-to-2006 change as the 2006 reserve minus the 2005 reserve: $10 million - $4 million = $6 million.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"reserve_2006 - reserve_2005","variables":{"reserve_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"reserve_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"reserve_2006":"source:q11n3","reserve_2005":"source:q11n4"}}}